# Payments

Financial data is sensitive and auditable. Never invent gateway request/response formats — read the supplied gateway docs first (request/response, signature, callback, requery, refund, settlement, timeouts, idempotency).

## Security

Gateway secrets stay server-side only. Never in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`, client bundles, or unsanitized logs.

## Idempotency

Callbacks may repeat. Dedupe via transaction ID / gateway reference / payment reference / idempotency key. Status transitions must be deterministic.

## History

Do not hard-delete Payment, PaymentTransaction, PaymentCallback, Refund, Settlement unless legally required. Prefer status transitions + audit.

## Offline collections

Separately identifiable: Cash, Cheque, DD, Manual UPI, Other. Unique receipt numbers. Record collector, date, amount, mode, reference, property/survey, remarks. All modifications audited.
